# The slate through its real keys, from a normal start: it wakes over the
# drifting coast, a new game starts, its edge overlay in the world, then every
# app opened with the keys a player presses, and shot.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/slate.tour --scene=title
wait 0.1
shot 01-title-asleep
await title 40
shot 02-title-awake
tap move_down
wait 0.2
shot 02b-title-coast-row
tap move_down
tap use
wait 0.3
shot 03-title-keys
tap pause
wait 0.2
tap move_up
tap move_up
wait 0.2
shot 04-title-new-game
tap use
# "New game" opens the character page now (docs/DESIGN.md §Who wakes), so the
# title no longer goes straight to a world. Begin is its last row and the list
# wraps, so one step up from the top reaches it. Without this the tour was red
# here on main, six lines before the line anybody had noticed.
await character 8
wait 0.3
shot 04b-who-wakes
key move_up
key use
await game 40
wait 2.5
shot 05-hud-in-the-world
walk 1,0 1.2
shot 06-hud-walked
# Carrying, then the map by its own key: the glass switches app.
tap inventory
await app:inventory 3
shot 07-carrying with app:inventory
tap move_down
wait 0.2
shot 08-carrying-down
tap map
await app:map 3
shot 09-map with app:map
tap use
wait 0.3
shot 10-map-scaled
tap map
await app:none 3
# Making: the spawn stands by the village square's fire.
try 3
tap craft
await app:crafting 3
end
shot 11-making with app:crafting
tap pause
await app:none 3
# Home, and the apps that live under it.
tap pause
await app:pause 3
shot 12-home with app:pause
# Home's tabs name their keys: carrying's opens over home, and Esc comes back.
tap inventory
await app:inventory 3
shot 12b-carrying-over-home
tap pause
await app:pause 3
tap move_down
tap use
await app:loadout 3
shot 13-gear with app:loadout
tap pause
await app:pause 3
tap move_down
tap use
await app:reads 3
shot 14-machine-reads with app:reads
tap pause
await app:pause 3
# Twice: home keeps the row it was left on, and the journal was added between
# machine reads and saves, so one step down now lands on the journal. This is
# the count that made line 75 red on main.
tap move_down
tap move_down
tap use
await app:saves 3
shot 15-saves with app:saves
tap pause
await app:pause 3
tap move_down
tap use
wait 0.3
shot 16-controls
tap pause
wait 0.2
tap pause
await app:none 3
wait 0.5
shot 17-back-in-the-world with app:none
